A||||51||L.I. Fieros||Anyone Tried SpiralMax?||||5||
Z||000000||L.I. Fieros||11-12-2000||07:02 PM||||Has anyone tried this SpiralMax device?  I was just over at their web site reading some of the users feedback and was trying to tell if it was total B.S. or not.  Of course they don't have the Fiero listed, but I'm sure one of them would fit.<P>See ya,<BR>Dave||||reg||5
Z||000001||DaRkLoRD||11-12-2000||07:51 PM||||The effectiveness of a device like this depends on which engine it is used in.. I've heard from one forum member that there is NO increase by using a Spiralmax in a Fiero. I wouldn't waste your money..<P>It's a known fact that a spiral can travel faster than a straight flow, so it stands to reason that a properly designed spiral-causing devices like this or the Tornado would have some increase in a straight pipe.. but the fiero intake is already quite efficient, and therefore there wouldn't be any increase. This might not be the case on all vehicles however, so don't judge a product as being BS when it doesn't work on your vehicle of choice.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||3
Z||000002||lou_dias||11-13-2000||12:03 AM||||I had one in mine...  Seemed to boost bottom end torque  and give me better fuel economy.  their's definitely a difference in performance.  I took it off for a while without resetting the computer and after a few weeks, the car started running better.  I think I will put it back on just to see the difference again.||||reg||1
Z||000003||overlord||11-13-2000||12:21 AM||||this was from spiralmax's user comments section.<BR>"Thank You! SpiralMax. This device made my Pontiac Fiero perform smoothly along with a much faster acceleration. I honestly felt an unbelievable 20 HP gain from this inexpensive device. I have gotten better mileage and I also saved a lot of gas. It paid me back gas within 2 months. It felt like I didn't spend a dime for this device. This is an incredible deal and so do my friends"<P>think ill pick one up, i dont see any harm it can do.||||reg||1
Z||000004||DaRkLoRD||11-13-2000||01:33 AM||||I find 20hp to be slightly unbelievable.. but, I've been wrong once or twice in the past.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Keep us posted on your results if you decide to get one.. Might be a good idea to get your car dynoed as well, if there's a facility near to you.<BR>I think spiralmax has a 30 day money back guarantee, so if you try it out and there's no performance, just return it and we'll all have learned a lesson.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||3
